    "ssky_text_image_block_trFXHH": {
      "type": "ssky-text-image-block",
      "blocks": {
        "section_header_nrX9Pm": {
          "type": "section_header",
          "settings": {
            "section_heading": "<p>Our Mission Is to Help You Teach Powerful Ideas and True History to Your Children</p>",
            "heading_size": "h1",
            "heading_weight": "bold",
            "heading_tag": "h2",
            "subheading": "",
            "text_style_subheading": "large-bold",
            "color_class_subheading": "primary-blue",
            "caption": "",
            "text_style": "large",
            "color_class": "primary-blue"
          }
        },
        "text_BWeWm9": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>As a parent wanting to teach your kids the values you hold dear, you may wonder:</p>",
            "text_size": "medium",
            "text_weight": "regular"
          }
        },
        "checkbox_xgRjXi": {
          "type": "checkbox",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Can my kids really understand economic ideas? Do I need to teach them about it?</p>",
            "text_large": true
          }
        },
        "checkbox_HTBtkh": {
          "type": "checkbox",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>How can I inspire my kids to love America and the ideas taught by the Founding Fathers?</p>",
            "text_large": true
          }
        },
        "checkbox_pDWwC7": {
          "type": "checkbox",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>How do I give my kids a foundation of freedom so they aren’t swept up by the crazy ideas being promoted on social media and by the government and media?</p>",
            "text_large": true
          }
        },
        "text_9ncrwa": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>While there are many books to teach the ideas of freedom to adults, there has been a profound void in the children’s literature market. The Tuttle Twins series closes the gap, helping parents convey the principles of freedom to their kids in a fun way.</p>",
            "text_size": "medium",
            "text_weight": "regular"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "section_header_nrX9Pm",
        "text_BWeWm9",
