            "text": "<p>Each of our books focuses on a different aspect of the principles of a free society: free markets, entrepreneurship, individual rights, personal responsibility, sound money, protectionism, and a variety of other issues—all boiled down to core concepts that children of different ages can easily grasp.</p>",
